# sgo.build — plan 0038's call-out leg. An ObjC bridge with NO Go in it: the
# whole point is to find where Sgola stops, so this module has no godep of a
# hand-written shim. `purego` is an ordinary Go module dependency, reached
# through a facade in the app's own sources.
mode app
emitname objc-spike
binname objc-spike
gomod objcspike
godep github.com/adriaanm/wata/go-pkgs/puredep ../go-pkgs/puredep
